  "title_lines": [
   "Fusion categories via string diagrams",
   "Bruce Bartlett"
  ],
  "abstract": "We use the string diagram calculus to give graphical proofs of the basic results of Etingof, Nikshych and Ostrik [9] on fusion categories. These results include: the quadruple dual is canonically isomorphic to the identity, positivity of the paired dimensions, and Ocneanu rigidity. We introduce the pairing convention as a convenient graphical framework for working with fusion categories. We use this framework to express the pivotal operators as a product of the apex associator monodromy and the pivotal indicators. We also characterize pivotal structures as solutions of an explicit set of algebraic equations over the complex numbers.",
